  "name": "The Two Fords",
  "description": "A fertile valley for two. One channel runs the whole map north to south and only two fords cross it. A cross spur on each bank means you either hug the water or swing wide to reach them, and the boomerang ridge cupping each start makes the back door terrain rather than a wall. Nothing haunts this valley: it is the plain match, with no Sepulcher to distract either side.",
